@startuml mdoc_proximity_components_ko
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam padding 4

actor "사용자" as user

rectangle "월렛 (소지자)" {
    component "인가앱" as ca
    component "Wallet SDK\n- DeviceRequest 매칭\n- DeviceResponse 생성" as sdk
    component "Proximity SDK (소지자)\n- Device Engagement\n- 세션 암호화 · 전송" as ph
}

rectangle "mdoc 리더" {
    component "리더 앱\n- 신뢰 발급자 목록 ·\n  DID Document 저장" as rd
    component "Proximity SDK (리더)\n- Device Engagement\n- 세션 암호화 · 전송\n- DeviceResponse 검증" as pr
}

component "Trust Agent\n(신뢰 발급자 목록)" as ta
database "신뢰저장소\n(발급자 DID Document)" as repo

user -right-> ca
ca -down-> sdk
ca -down-> ph
ph -right-> pr : QR · NFC\nBLE · L2CAP · NFC · Wi-Fi Aware
rd -down-> ta : 신뢰 발급자 목록 조회
rd -down-> repo : 발급자 DID Document 조회
rd -left-> pr
@enduml

'--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

@startuml mdoc_proximity_seq_ko
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"
<style>
participant {
  Padding 20
}
</style>
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 400

actor "**사용자**" as user
participant "**월렛**\n(소지자)" as wal <<Wallet>>
participant "**mdoc 리더**" as rd <<App>>
participant "**Trust Agent**" as ta <<Server>>
participant "**신뢰저장소**" as repo <<Storage>>

== 사전준비 ==
rd -> ta ++: 신뢰 발급자 목록 요청
return {발급자 DID, 이름, 허용 docType}
rd -> repo: 발급자 DID Document 조회
rd -> rd: 목록 및 DID Document 저장

== Device Engagement 및 세션 수립 ==
user -> wal: 근접 제출 시작
wal -> rd: Device Engagement (QR 또는 NFC)
wal <-> rd: 전송 채널 연결, 세션 키 생성 (ECDH + HKDF)

== 요청 및 응답 ==
rd -> wal: DeviceRequest\n{docType, 데이터 요소, intent_to_retain = false}
wal -> wal: 저장된 mdoc 매칭
wal -> wal: DeviceResponse 생성 (deviceSignature)
wal -> rd: DeviceResponse (세션 암호화)

== 검증 ==
rd -> rd: 발급자 신뢰 판정\n* kid의 DID가 목록에 있는지, docType 허용 여부
rd -> rd: issuerAuth 서명 검증 (발급자 DID Document의 키)
rd -> rd: DeviceAuth 검증
rd -> rd: 검증 결과 표시
@enduml
